# Discord 配置模板

## 基础配置

```json
{
  "name": "discord",
  "description": "Discord 机器人配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "discord",
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "token": "YOUR_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN",
    "dmPolicy": "pairing",
    "groupPolicy": "allowlist",
    "streamMode": "partial"
  },
  "features": [
    "私聊对话",
    "服务器频道",
    "消息回复",
    "表情反应"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 访问 https://discord.com/developers/applications",
    "2. 创建新应用",
    "3. 在 Bot 页面创建机器人",
    "4. 复制 Bot Token",
    "5. 配置权限（Message Content 必需）",
    "6. 邀请机器人到服务器",
    "7. 配置到 OpenClaw",
    "8. 重启 Gateway"
  ],
  "requiredPermissions": [
    "Send Messages",
    "Read Message History",
    "Add Reactions",
    "Use Slash Commands"
  ]
}
```

## 高级配置

```json
{
  "config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "token": "YOUR_BOT_TOKEN",
    "dmPolicy": "pairing",
    "groupPolicy": "allowlist",
    "dm": {
      "allowFrom": []
    },
    "group": {
      "allowFrom": []
    },
    "streamMode": "partial",
    "mentionPattern": "@ClawBot"
  }
}
```

## 邀请链接格式

```
https://discord.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&permissions=274877909504&scope=bot%20applications.commands
```

## 所需权限

- **Send Messages** - 发送消息
- **Read Message History** - 读取消息历史
- **Add Reactions** - 添加表情
- **Use Slash Commands** - 使用斜杠命令
- **Message Content Intent** - 消息内容（必需）

## 文件位置
`templates/channels/discord.json`
